store-category-spellbook-curses = Curses
spellbook-wizard-ancient-name = Curse of the Ancients
spellbook-wizard-ancient-description = Force the burdens of history upon one unlucky soul. They'll be forced to move only in full tiles at a time. Cured by holy water. Range: Touch
spellbook-wizard-moods-name = Curse of Hysteria
spellbook-wizard-moods-description = Gives the target one random new Thaven mood. Cured by Psicodine. Range: Touch
spellbook-wizard-summon-bees-name = Summon Bees
spellbook-wizard-summon-bees-description = Summons a swarm of bees, they're angry, they're very angry, what did you expect? Range: Self
spellbook-wizard-doom-name = Curse of Doom
spellbook-wizard-doom-description = Give the target foresight into their own demise, they must complete a task and alter their own timeline in 60 seconds or die. Range: Touch
spellbook-wizard-interior-rustic-name = Interior Redecorating
spellbook-wizard-interior-rustic-description = Channel nature to convert nearby floors, walls, windows, and doors into something a little more organic. Gnome and garden approved! Range: 4
wizard-doom-indicator-description = Your future is doomed! Complete this task within one minute or die: {$objective}
wizard-doom-hug = Hug someone.
wizard-doom-get-hugged = Get someone to hug you.
wizard-doom-sit = Sit in a chair for three seconds.
wizard-doom-lie = Lie down for five seconds.
wizard-doom-eat = Eat something.
wizard-doom-drink = Drink something.
wizard-doom-get-punched = Get someone to punch you.
wizard-doom-throw = Throw something.
wizard-doom-punch = Punch someone.
action-speech-spell-wizard-undecided = MAGIC!
action-speech-spell-wizard-mass-swap = CHANGE PLACES!
action-speech-spell-wizard-frog = KERM'TUS
action-speech-spell-wizard-chain-lightning = OMNIS POTENS!
action-speech-spell-wizard-stop-time = ZAWAR`DO
action-speech-spell-wizard-stop-time-tts = ZAWAR DO
wizard-frog-hug-success = Your hug undoes the spell on {THE($target)}.
spellbook-wizard-frog-name = Frog
spellbook-wizard-frog-description = Curse a target into the form of a frog. Only a hug or damage can cure them. Range: Touch
spellbook-wizard-perspective-name = New Perspective
spellbook-wizard-perspective-description = Make a target dizzy, twisting their view until they take a moment to sit on a chair and recover. Range: 4
spellbook-wizard-missile-name = Magic Missile
spellbook-wizard-missile-description = Fire a slow homing orb at every nearby target, hits knock them down temporarily. Range: 4
spellbook-wizard-snail-name = Curse of the Snail
spellbook-wizard-snail-description = Force a target to crawl like a snail, they'll even leave a slippery trail! Range: 3
spellbook-wizard-noir-name = Curse of Noir
spellbook-wizard-noir-description = Give a target Noir Vision, forcing them to see the world in black, white and red until they have a drink at the bar. Range: 4
spellbook-wizard-mass-swap-name = Crowd Swap
spellbook-wizard-mass-swap-description = Shuffle the locations of all nearby living creatures within 5 tiles, who knows where you'll end up!
action-speech-spell-wizard-magic-missile = FORTI GY AMA!
action-speech-spell-wizard-magic-missile-tts = FORTI GY AMA!
spellbook-wizard-static-electricity-name = Static Electricity
spellbook-wizard-static-electricity-description = Curse a target to shock anyone who touches them. Cured by eating insulated gloves. Range: Touch
wizard-static-electricity-eat-gloves = Eat insulated gloves
spellbook-wizard-zero-gravity-name = Gravity Shift
spellbook-wizard-zero-gravity-description = Turns off gravity in a localized area, leaving too quickly will cause you to fall flat on your face! Range: Self
spellbook-wizard-tornado-name = Tornado
spellbook-wizard-tornado-description = Send forth a vortex of wind to pull and spin everything nearby. Travels in a line.
spellbook-wizard-grease-name = Grease
spellbook-wizard-grease-description = Spread slippery, flammable welding fuel over a 4x4 area. Range: 5
spellbook-wizard-sleeping-cloud-name = Sleeping Cloud
spellbook-wizard-sleeping-cloud-description = Releases a gas that puts everyone to sleep! Conjures a magical grenade to your hand.
spellbook-wizard-combust-name = Combust
spellbook-wizard-combust-description = Releases a gas that quickly detonates explosively. Conjures a magical grenade to your hand.
wizard-gas-ball-hands-full = You need a free hand to conjure this.
spellbook-wizard-magical-sauna-name = Magical Sauna
spellbook-wizard-magical-sauna-description = Detonates into a sauna of magical steam! Conjures a magical grenade to your hand.
spellbook-wizard-stink-cloud-name = Stink Cloud
spellbook-wizard-stink-cloud-description = Releases a choking cloud of ammonia. Conjures a magical grenade to your hand.
spellbook-wizard-trash-golem-name = Trash Golem
spellbook-wizard-trash-golem-description = Conjures an obedient golem out of all that non-magical junk they leave sitting around. The more valuable the stuff, the better the golem!
spellbook-wizard-asphyxiate-name = Asphyxiate
spellbook-wizard-asphyxiate-description = Consume all oxygen in a 3x3 area for 10 seconds. Range: 5
spellbook-wizard-cone-of-hellfire-name = Cone of Hellfire
spellbook-wizard-cone-of-hellfire-description = Release a cone of hellfire, also probably run. Range: 2
spellbook-wizard-cone-of-cold-name = Cone of Cold
spellbook-wizard-cone-of-cold-description = Freeze your foes in a gust of magical wind that encases them in ice and pushes them away! Deals 30 cold damage. Range: 3
spellbook-wizard-summon-gun-name = Staff of Many Guns
spellbook-wizard-summon-gun-description = Conjures a random spectral gun that fires in the targeted direction for ten seconds. Results may vary.
spellbook-wizard-random-creature-wand-name = Wand of Random Creatures
spellbook-wizard-random-creature-wand-description = Summons a random creature who will consider you friendly, good luck to everyone else. Five Charges.
spellbook-wizard-chain-lightning-name = Chain Lightning
spellbook-wizard-chain-lightning-description = Unleash the power of lightning! Strikes a living target for 40 shock damage. Chains to the nearest new target within 3 tiles twice and deals decreased damage. Range: 5
spellbook-wizard-dimension-door-name = Dimension Door
spellbook-wizard-dimension-door-description = Create a two way portal to somewhere else, where? Not sure, try it and find out! Remains until cancelled. May have side effects. Range: Touch
spellbook-wizard-arcane-barrage-name = Arcane Barrage
spellbook-wizard-arcane-barrage-description = Raise a barrage of 15 homing orbs, they'll split among nearby targets, dealing 3 blunt and 10 stamina damage each. Upgradable
spellbook-wizard-arcane-barrage-upgrade-name = Upgrade Arcane Barrage
spellbook-wizard-arcane-barrage-upgrade-description = -NR- Upgrade Arcane Barrage to Arcane Flurry, then Arcane Storm. Each tier adds 15 orbs.
spellbook-wizard-lightning-barrage-name = Lightning Barrage
spellbook-wizard-lightning-barrage-description = Raise a barrage of 15 lightning balls, they seek out nearby targets and deal 3 shock damage, bouncing up to 2 times.
spellbook-wizard-lightning-barrage-upgrade-name = Upgrade Lightning Barrage
spellbook-wizard-lightning-barrage-upgrade-description = -NR- Upgrade Lightning Barrage to Lightning Flurry, then Lightning Storm. Each tier adds 15 orbs.
spellbook-wizard-invisibility-curse-name = Curse of Invisibility
spellbook-wizard-invisibility-curse-description = Curse a target with invisibility until they attack or take damage. Is this even a curse? Range: 5
spellbook-wizard-dominate-mind-name = Dominate Mind
spellbook-wizard-dominate-mind-description = Compel an unshielded target to serve and protect you. Can be broken by a mindshield. Range: Touch
spellbook-wizard-apprenticeship-name = Contract of Apprenticeship
spellbook-wizard-apprenticeship-description = Want to be my apprentice? Sign here. Comes with complementary robes, wand and a limited spellbook.
spellbook-wizard-random-curse-wand-name = Wand of Random Curses
spellbook-wizard-random-curse-wand-description = Applies a random curse. 5 Charges
spellbook-wizard-meteor-swarm-name = Meteor Swarm
spellbook-wizard-meteor-swarm-description = Strike a 7x7 area with 2-4 meteors, generally a terrible idea.
