wizard-apprentice-contract-bound = Has a magical seal on it and everything. Get your apprentice to sign this.
wizard-apprentice-contract-signed = You bind yourself as an apprentice to {$wizard}
wizard-apprentice-contract-paper-unbound = A wizard must bind this contract before it can be signed. -NR-Open it as a wizard to bind it.
wizard-apprentice-contract-paper-bound = -NR- Contract of Apprenticeship. By signing, you become an apprentice to {$wizard}.
wizard-apprentice-contract-invalid-signer = -NR- You cannot sign this contract.
wizard-apprentice-contract-pack-failed = -NR- The apprentice supplies could not be prepared.
wizard-domination-briefing = Your mind has been dominated by {$wizard}
    You are now an antagonist.
    You are compelled to follow their commands and protect them to the best of your ability.
    Work with others under the wizard’s control. Achieve great things.
    A magical force prevents you from willingly revealing your domination, or seeking to have it removed.
wizard-apprentice-briefing = You are now an apprentice to {$wizard}. You are forbidden from harming them intentionally. Follow their teachings and accomplish magical goals together.
wizard-unknown-master = the wizard
wizard-domination-freed = The wizards domination over your mind fades...
wizard-apprentice-role-subtype = wizard apprentice
wizard-dominated-role-subtype = dominated by wizard
wizard-apprentice-backpack-failed = Your hands are full; the apprentice backpack is at your feet.
wizard-stop-time-frozen = You are frozen in time!
wizard-stop-time-resumed = Time flows again.
